# 番茄小说去广告规则 (Clash classical / Shadowrocket RULE-SET 通用格式)
#
# 引用: Clash  -> rule-provider(behavior: classical) -> RULE-SET,fanqie_ads,REJECT
#       小火箭 -> RULE-SET,<本文件URL>,REJECT
#
# 只拦「广告 SDK / 广告素材 / 埋点上报」域名, 不碰正文 API 与书籍封面、正文图片。
#
# 来源(合并去重后重写):
#   [A] https://github.com/deezertidal/shadowrocket-rules/blob/main/modules/fanqie.module
#   [B] https://github.com/honue/rules/blob/master/Loon/plugin/FanQieNovel.plugin
#   [C] https://github.com/changzhaoCZ/fqnovel-adrules/blob/master/fqnovel-fxxk_ads
#   [D] https://github.com/zqzess/rule_for_quantumultX/blob/master/AdguardHome/FanQieNovel.txt
#       A=deezertidal 模块  B=honue 插件(A 的超集)  C=番茄屠龙刀(规则最新)  D=2022 旧版, 仅作对照
#
# 下列域名番茄自带、需放行, 故意不拦(拦了会坏功能):
#   reading.snssdk.com / security.snssdk.com / lf-fe.fqnovelstatic.com
#   lf-normal-gr-sourcecdn.bytegecko.com / api*-sinfnormal.fqnovel.com
#   api5-normal-sinfonlinec.fqnovel.com/reading/bookapi/ / p3-novel1-sign.byteimg.com

